MediaPipe Tasks Vision runtime and Selfie Multiclass segmentation model (Google)

Runtime: @mediapipe/tasks-vision 1.1.1, Apache-2.0
Official package: https://registry.npmjs.org/@mediapipe/tasks-vision/-/tasks-vision-1.1.1.tgz
Project: https://github.com/google-ai-edge/mediapipe
