Model: Selfie Multiclass 256x256 float32, version 1, Apache-2.0
Official model: https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-models/image_segmenter/selfie_multiclass_256x256/float32/1/selfie_multiclass_256x256.tflite
Model card and explicit model license: https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-assets/Model%20Card%20Multiclass%20Segmentation.pdf
Model card author: Adel Ahmadyan, Google; model date May 10, 2023.
The model predicts background, hair, body skin, face skin, clothes and accessories.
It supports human subjects; it is not a generic object or pet extraction model.
The model card describes accuracy limitations, including low light, backlighting,
noise, fast motion and occlusion. Pixel-perfect masks are not guaranteed.

Complete Apache License 2.0 text is in LICENSE.
Upstream license text: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google-ai-edge/mediapipe/v0.9.1/LICENSE
The included JavaScript, WASM and model files are unmodified upstream files.
Only the classic JavaScript runtime and SIMD/non-SIMD loader variants are included;
ES module and Node bundles, source maps and declarations are omitted.
Backdrop loads these files locally and on demand; no model/runtime network
request or photo upload is needed for extraction.

